        "message": "=A nurtured contact just replied with interest:\n\nName: {{ $('Parse Reply').item.json.customer_name }}\nPhone: {{ $('Parse Reply').item.json.customer_phone }}\nSegment: {{ $('Parse Reply').item.json.segment }}\n\nClassification: {{ $('Parse Reply').item.json.class }}\nWants service: {{ $('Parse Reply').item.json.wants_service }}\nSummary: {{ $('Parse Reply').item.json.summary }}\n\nThey said: \"{{ $('Parse Reply').item.json.message_body }}\"\n\nWe auto-replied: \"{{ $('Parse Reply').item.json.suggested_reply }}\"\n\nNurture is paused for this contact — follow up personally to book them.",
        "options": {}
